=== W1: all ones.  A holds, Delta grows LINEARLY. ===
  d_j = 1
     N=3000  0-confined (exact) = True   min Delta = 0.5850
     Delta_N/N      : liminf 0.584963   limsup 0.584963
     Delta_N/log2 N : max 151.922      max Delta_N = 1754.89
     => A does NOT imply D, E, F or G.  (liminf Delta/N = alpha-1 > 0.)

=== W2: geometric climb/descend stages.  D holds, E FAILS. ===
  climb/descend stages
     N=6000  0-confined (exact) = True   min Delta = 0.0090
     Delta_N/N      : liminf 0.000093   limsup 0.209963
     Delta_N/log2 N : max 84.995      max Delta_N = 1066.78
     => D holds (liminf -> 0) but E FAILS (limsup Delta/N stays positive),
        so D does NOT imply E.  F and G fail a fortiori.

=== W3: Delta_N ~ sqrt(N).  E holds, F FAILS. ===
  Delta ~ sqrt N
     N=4000  0-confined (exact) = True   min Delta = 0.5850
     Delta_N/N      : liminf 0.015713   limsup 0.099814
     Delta_N/log2 N : max 5.322      max Delta_N = 63.68
     => E holds but F FAILS, so E does NOT imply F.  In particular
        liminf Delta_N/N = 0 gives NO O(log N) or O(sqrt N) corridor.

=== W4: Delta_N bounded (G).  Exists symbolically. ===
  greedy d=2 when allowed
     N=4000  0-confined (exact) = True   min Delta = 0.0001
     Delta_N/N      : liminf 0.000000   limsup 0.008386
     Delta_N/log2 N : max 0.137      max Delta_N = 1.00
     => G holds symbolically (bounded Delta).  This word is NOT excluded
        symbolically; it is excluded for positive-integer orbits by the
        repository's bounded-drift theorems (see PRIOR_DETERMINISTIC_BARRIERS.md).

